<configs>

	<!-- ============================================================
	     FrilCleanDoors  v1.2.2  -  blocks.xml

	     Removes the boarded-up / planked appearance from doors that
	     show it at full health. Doors render clean when fully repaired
	     and as they take damage, instead of looking barricaded.

	     How it works: 7DTD doors have a boarded mesh state (DMG0) and a
	     clean mesh state (DMG1). MeshDamage thresholds decide which mesh
	     shows at a given HP. This mod sets the DMG0 threshold above the
	     door's MaxDamage so the boarded mesh is never reached, and sets
	     DMG1 to MaxDamage so the clean mesh covers full health. Lower
	     damage states (DMG2/DMG3) are left at vanilla values.

	     Formula: DMG0 = ceil(MaxDamage * 1.25), DMG1 = MaxDamage.
	     MaxDamage itself is NOT changed - door HP is vanilla.

	     Patches 30 base door blocks. Colour variants (blue, oak, red,
	     etc.) inherit via Extends - 255 doors covered in total.

	     v1.1.0: added iron garage doors (metal-panel barricade state).
	     v1.2.0: added shapes.xml - player-crafted window glass no
	             longer shatters on the first hit (see shapes.xml).
	     v1.2.1: tuned window Full multiplier 0.5 -> 0.1 - windows
	             survive a hit or two without significant durability
	             inflation (see shapes.xml).
	     v1.2.2: window shapes can now be upgraded normally (vanilla
	             10000-item upgrade trap removed - see shapes.xml).

	     Excluded (no boarded mesh state - confirmed in-game):
	       wooden fence doors, wooden garage doors, large wood gate,
	       trailer doors, and all metal/elevator/closet doors.
	     ============================================================ -->

